          <li><strong>Matched Installations:</strong> We size circuits to your actual vehicle and driving patterns rather than defaulting to over-built or under-sized configurations.</li>
          <li><strong>Nearby Dispatch:</strong> Our 612 Jasmine Pl NW office enables rapid response to Greenwood Point for both scheduled and urgent service calls.</li>
          <li><strong>Full Code Compliance:</strong> Every installation is permitted through City of Issaquah or WA L&I and built to NEC Article 625 standards.</li>
          <li><strong>Clear Communication:</strong> We explain what work is needed and why, provide straightforward assessments, and never recommend unnecessary upgrades.</li>
        </ol>

        <h2>Our Service Process</h2>
        <ol>
          <li><strong>Phone Consultation:</strong> We collect your vehicle model, charger preference, and any issues you are experiencing to prepare the right materials.</li>
          <li><strong>On-Site Survey:</strong> Our electrician inspects your panel, calculates available capacity, and plans the optimal conduit route and charger placement.</li>
          <li><strong>Professional Installation:</strong> We install the dedicated circuit, mount the charger, and connect everything with properly torqued, code-compliant connections.</li>
          <li><strong>Vehicle Testing:</strong> We plug in your vehicle, verify charging speed, confirm voltage stability, and ensure everything operates correctly.</li>
        </ol>

        <p>
          Call <a href="tel:+14253800019">(425) 380-0019</a> to schedule your Greenwood Point EV charger installation or diagnostic visit.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
